<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 16:05:43 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>“这个岛是首屈一指的”：特朗普表示将在“我们美丽的新”格陵兰岛开始“大规模”石油、天然气和矿产勘探</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/14/trump-oil-gas-mineral-exploration-greenland/</link><description>上个月，特朗普与丹麦和格陵兰岛领导人签署了一项协议，以加强北极和北大西洋的安全。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AP26266587574802-e1791990530687.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 15:23:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/14/trump-oil-gas-mineral-exploration-greenland/</guid></item><item><title>Fragment 融资 1200 万美元，帮助防止 AI 代理滥用公司资金</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/14/fragment-raises-12-million-to-help-keep-ai-agents-from-going-rogue-with-company-money/</link><description>这家总部位于纽约的初创公司开发了软件，可以在付款清算之前仔细检查交易数学。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Fragment_Thomas_Neckel_0358_HIGH-1-e1791945112498.jpeg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 13:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/14/fragment-raises-12-million-to-help-keep-ai-agents-from-going-rogue-with-company-money/</guid></item><item><title>半导体供应商 ASML 超出预期，欧洲、美国期货上涨</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/14/europe-us-futures-rise-semiconductor-supplier-asml-beats-expectations/</link><description>由于巴黎正在努力应对其国债，目前许多目光都集中在法国债券市场上。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2281711644-e1791970997168.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 09:53:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/14/europe-us-futures-rise-semiconductor-supplier-asml-beats-expectations/</guid></item><item><title>FBI 逮捕 OpenAI 员工，指控其在会议室放置秘密录音装置</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/13/fbi-arrests-openai-employee-charged-planting-secret-recording-device-conference-room/</link><description>嫌疑人 Abdulrahman Alfozan 是沙特公民，于 2025 年加入 OpenAI。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/alfozanchecking_on_device.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 00:09:31 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/13/fbi-arrests-openai-employee-charged-planting-secret-recording-device-conference-room/</guid></item><item><title>精英大学的大学专业内部，毕业生的收入超过 25 万美元，是同龄人的 4 倍多</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/14/college-majors-at-elite-universities-with-earnings-over-two-hundred-thousand-dollars-gen-z-education-struggles/</link><description>卡内基梅隆大学有 6 个项目的毕业生年收入超过 15 万美元，是榜单上所有大学中收入最高的。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-1969466280-e1791989483603.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 15:01:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/14/college-majors-at-elite-universities-with-earnings-over-two-hundred-thousand-dollars-gen-z-education-struggles/</guid></item><item><title>应用材料公司耗资 50 亿美元的人工智能实验室旨在将芯片开发时间缩短一半，并恢复硅谷的优势</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/13/applied-materials-advanced-ai-chips-epic-semiconductor-silicon-valley/</link><description>领先的芯片制造设备制造商应用材料公司与英特尔、美光、SK海力士、三星电子等合作伙伴正式揭牌其EPIC芯片研发中心。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AP-Select-1-EPIC-Center-Building-e1791926053751.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 23:15:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/13/applied-materials-advanced-ai-chips-epic-semiconductor-silicon-valley/</guid></item><item><title>沃尔玛继承人奥利维亚沃尔顿没有得到她需要的产后护理。现在，她投资 1 亿美元，力求在 5 年内将美国孕产妇死亡率降低一半</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/13/walmart-heir-olivia-walton-postpartum-care-investing-100-million-halve-us-maternal-mortality-rate/</link><description>奥利维亚·沃尔顿 (Olivia Walton) 创立了“健康妈妈、健康婴儿美国”组织，她正在使用“工具箱中的所有工具”来改善孕产妇健康，并呼吁雇主提高福利。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/55587218408_01dc807ef4_o-e1791910807634.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 17:37:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/13/walmart-heir-olivia-walton-postpartum-care-investing-100-million-halve-us-maternal-mortality-rate/</guid></item><item><title>“我们说服自己不要这样做”：企业家艾玛·格雷德从不事后怀疑自己</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/13/emma-grede-business-advice-skims-off-season/</link><description>Grede 与 Kim Kardashian 和丈夫 Jens Grede 共同创立了价值 50 亿美元的塑身衣品牌 Skims。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/55587876670_1d5e8eb640_o-e1791918602151.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 21:19:50 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/13/emma-grede-business-advice-skims-off-season/</guid></item><item><title>山姆会员店首席执行官拉特里丝·沃特金斯 (Latrice Watkins) 表示，看到自己投资的人取得成功，她感到最有力量</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/13/sams-club-ceo-latriece-watkins-says-she-feels-most-powerful-watching-the-people-shes-invested-in-succeed/</link><description>拉特里丝·沃特金斯 (Latrice Watkins) 表示，帮助他人取得成功是互惠互利的，并建议企业领导者留出时间来明确领导力。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/55587514396_f0863fe96e_o-e1791927624136.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 21:55:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/13/sams-club-ceo-latriece-watkins-says-she-feels-most-powerful-watching-the-people-shes-invested-in-succeed/</guid></item><item><title>詹妮弗·西贝尔·纽森谈她作为加州第一合伙人的遗产：同工同酬“还不够”，所以她转向女性财富</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/13/jennifer-siebel-newsom-on-her-legacy-as-california-first-partner-women-wealth-pay-equity/</link><description>在《财富》杂志最具影响力女性峰会上，詹妮弗·西贝尔·纽瑟姆 (Jennifer Siebel Newsom) 指出，女性创始人的金融知识、储蓄计划和资本是她努力缩小女性贫富差距的一部分。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/55587924453_34d0591488_o.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 22:07:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/13/jennifer-siebel-newsom-on-her-legacy-as-california-first-partner-women-wealth-pay-equity/</guid></item></channel></rss>